{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：20:19 2026-10-10 HKT</p>\n\n<p>NBA中國賽澳門站今日（10日）迎來兩場比賽之間的休息日，但一眾球星的場外行程依然緊密。大會特意舉辦「NBA球迷日」回饋大眾，獨行俠二年級新星法拉格（Cooper Flagg）與人氣男團MIRROR成員姜濤兩位「人氣王」同場較量，成為全日最大亮點。兩人在技巧大賽決賽中正面交鋒，最終法拉格領軍的隊伍險勝奪冠；而姜濤則在活動尾聲壓軸獻唱，為球迷帶來雙重驚喜。</p>\n<img alt=\"法拉格在球迷日表現十分搶眼。魏國謙攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ee13751456e49a50047f7c7decc4a3b8/2026-10/HIM_0956.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"三分大賽。魏國謙攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9527ad88fa48cd3a2c572ba2edeca35f/2026-10/HIM_1650.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"三分大賽。魏國謙攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d63c5c9181e814ce20eeeef506dede45/2026-10/HIM_1477.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"CAM HAZZARD是大鯊魚奧尼爾創辦的扣籃聯盟DUNKMAN的冠軍。魏國謙攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2ef7ef32937de01903a0ed969fe03209/2026-10/HIM_1832.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"國家隊籃球名宿朱芳雨參加投籃之星比賽。魏國謙攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c176c3c6b081f0635e8efaae7d35ca00/2026-10/HIM_1097.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"NBA球迷日。魏國謙攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3441bedf2c83cbe424542d700fabf3a4/2026-10/HIM_1636.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"韓國跳唱歌手EVAN。魏國謙攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e5854346eb2551c31d6a6be25d03a205/2026-10/HIM_0727.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"現場派禮物環節氣氛熱烈。魏國謙攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/42930a566256975260ccb34718267987/2026-10/HIM_1979.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"艾榮雖然沒有上場比賽，但亦十分投入。魏國謙攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8d5a25efced48c6e4452b54bccbce12f/2026-10/HIM_1717.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳登星同樣參加扣籃大賽表演。魏國謙攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/345662815827969e832c31ad08df1e02/2026-10/HIM_1951.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"三分球大賽。魏國謙攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5a0e70f66c2ec96583d938ca4ce4a3a3/2026-10/HIM_1678.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"法拉格表現搶眼。魏國謙攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8292099e959767edccaf86b0669777a5/2026-10/HIM_1007.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"法拉格表現搶眼。魏國謙攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1c8288f78145539294234b7b6887d489/2026-10/HIM_0963.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"法拉格表現搶眼。魏國謙攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5fcd6f794b5aab70ee5350bc981448bc/2026-10/HIM_1352.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"EVAN參加投籃之星大賽。魏國謙攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ff55162611bb5c391f1f66a7cf541293/2026-10/HIM_1040.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳登星。魏國謙攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9930ce6ef7eeb336d164048f1850acdd/2026-10/HIM_1909.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"扣籃大賽。魏國謙攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/00387675e57deb01def9ccc25424e69f/2026-10/HIM_1787.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"法拉格表現十分搶眼。魏國謙攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/164154db406963d49aa41e9c1f905fdc/2026-10/HIM_1019.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"投籃之星大賽。魏國謙攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cd362dbe891744eb5c91123f59f400fe/2026-10/HIM_1124.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"投籃之星大賽。魏國謙攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9fad648a0621e915d6a899bbc512f1b1/2026-10/HIM_1056.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"斯麥同樣參加技巧大賽。魏國謙攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9198a6e8c937a6aeb8156b50474d48e1/2026-10/HIM_1208.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"歐陽靖參加球迷日活動。魏國謙攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9e280882e9cbbdecb79fbe9aca6ed8a9/2026-10/HIM_1419.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"獨行俠小將基斯提。魏國謙攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a328cd232511cf22fd3e1487baa558f1/2026-10/HIM_1531.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳登星。魏國謙攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a2c1c35bccaba2f74263a54addb0fa24/2026-10/HIM_1962.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姜濤、歐陽靖和林書豪。魏國謙攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cf8fb90d37ebdff4935ac505a65023d9/2026-10/HIM_0924.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"艾榮十分興奮。魏國謙攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5c5e1539914e0da3e3f0576f4689c739/2026-10/HIM_1628.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"EVAN賣力表演。魏國謙攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/977a911f78d97f1397519bb3ac28da8b/2026-10/HIM_0742.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"法拉格獲得技巧賽冠軍後十分興奮。魏國謙攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/91fa70dfb923228eb9002b258143e18d/2026-10/HIM_1380.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姜濤和林書豪在場邊觀賽。魏國謙攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/52d44191faed74a117a704f28f2c8370/2026-10/HIM_0882.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"三分大賽。魏國謙攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d1bc2205beec4fe76dc1159b4f1352dc/2026-10/HIM_1505.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"EVAN表演。魏國謙攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fd3bd6ee068d2eaec7d832580f2faa33/2026-10/HIM_0818.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"法拉格表現十分搶眼。魏國謙攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7ca581f51db1dbc1bb24a70377bb45f0/2026-10/HIM_1362.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"法拉格所在的隊伍在技巧大賽中獲得冠軍。魏國謙攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/77431c3416ac2e47b1abd88fdcb43bd1/2026-10/HIM_1188.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林書豪。魏國謙攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8043db283c256495e9bbe109ae15020a/2026-10/HIM_1331.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"三分大賽。魏國謙攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d88f0bd33d930043ecbfa5f4c96f7dc8/2026-10/HIM_1546.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"歐陽靖。魏國謙攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c8f98e3b9165b50ef12a777dd8fbf958/2026-10/HIM_0907.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"法拉格。魏國謙攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/29bb1378efd12a4612d49692291158b4/2026-10/HIM_1285.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"EVAN。魏國謙攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c72fc32d2b1cdd60ba577b2b0021a66d/2026-10/HIM_0763.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"艾文湯遜。魏國謙攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/aae39bf67fbf83b6de8cefaaddc7defc/2026-10/HIM_1273.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"獨行俠全隊在場中央慶祝。魏國謙攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/464e319528d3099ed887ef22c2f3e34a/2026-10/HIM_1578.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"法拉格。魏國謙攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f60aff609e97085867770a103905cef2/2026-10/HIM_0976.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"朱芳雨。魏國謙攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1e19fe418dbbe742ad4e0e950c847787/2026-10/HIM_1144.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"艾榮十分投入。魏國謙攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f490ff0196e18dbd326d8e264baf1332/2026-10/HIM_1385.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"歐陽靖。魏國謙攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9e5f18b0e19ce0c2fd3e628bb066c5a9/2026-10/HIM_0896.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"EVAN。魏國謙攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1eeaf8b74900991002313e854993f982/2026-10/HIM_0840.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林書豪。魏國謙攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b490dd95f572a283e4d5b8a0a698ea7c/2026-10/HIM_1343.jpg\"/>\n<h2>法拉格現身NBA House 展現親民一面</h2>\n<p>獨行俠小將法拉格無疑是今次澳門站最受矚目的新星之一。他今日率先現身人山人海的NBA House，出席運動飲料品牌活動。面對熱情的球迷，法拉格展現出十足的親和力，不僅親自上陣參與投籃挑戰，更與粉絲進行考驗敏捷度的反應力比拼遊戲。現場氣氛相當熱烈，不少球迷更對著這位潛力新星高呼「MVP」。</p>\n<h2>技巧賽星將雲集 法拉格險勝姜濤林書豪</h2>\n<p>隨後舉行的「NBA球迷日」將氣氛推向高潮。大會安排了投籃之星、技巧大賽、三分大賽及入樽賽等經典環節。其中，技巧大賽的陣容最為吸睛，法拉格與兩位網絡紅人（KOL）組隊，一路過關斬將殺入決賽。</p>\n<p>他們在決賽面對的對手陣容星光熠熠——由另一位人氣王姜濤，聯同傳奇球星林書豪及火箭小將艾文湯臣（Amen Thompson）組隊出戰。兩隊在決賽中互有攻守，表現落力，最終法拉格的隊伍在細節處理上技高一籌，險勝姜濤與林書豪的組合，順利拿下技巧大賽冠軍。</p>\n<img alt=\"姜濤參加技巧大賽。魏國謙攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/72c056f3b42d1f9dc608f3ee3fc15664/2026-10/HIM_1254.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林書豪和姜濤。魏國謙攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6910a55276902efbedd0b3dac69e13aa/2026-10/HIM_1203.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姜濤在技巧大賽中。魏國謙攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/15ff6e7c24da951557d4420a1ea9a53c/2026-10/HIM_1297.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姜濤壓軸表演。魏國謙攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9b3ccff6c17612fc404c5b2289311cb5/2026-10/HIM_2152.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姜濤壓軸表演。魏國謙攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/868796a5911817eb6f13baad3d2b2687/2026-10/HIM_2082.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姜濤壓軸表演。魏國謙攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4d4cfec066fea513dbe5cfff9dc15b87/2026-10/HIM_2014.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姜濤壓軸表演。魏國謙攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c30f7c0a67a15d34fd8a815f0a6255f8/2026-10/HIM_2031.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姜濤壓軸表演。魏國謙攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/83465fae34c833b10f518cb2f82caf89/2026-10/HIM_2068.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姜濤壓軸表演。魏國謙攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/aa9b0843dd94cc08a3faf14a78a4e6a0/2026-10/HIM_2101.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姜濤壓軸表演。魏國謙攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f9c50ffecfd90949b9f6073ed5cef027/2026-10/HIM_2114.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"姜濤壓軸表演。魏國謙攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/54701be2e8af941c1a7073c60e67598a/2026-10/HIM_2120.jpg\"/>\n<h2>姜濤落力作賽 跳唱壓軸</h2>\n<p>雖然在技巧大賽中惜敗，但姜濤在籃球場上的投入程度依然贏得全場掌聲。連續兩年作為球迷日的壓軸嘉賓，姜濤在各項賽事結束後，為現場觀眾帶來了精彩的跳唱演出。他一口氣獻唱了三首歌曲，誠意十足。</p>\n<p>記者/攝影：楊功煜、魏國謙</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-10T12:38:17.731963+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":728,"images":57,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}